    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Mek Gunz",
    "summary": "After this unit shoots in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), if every Mek Gunz model in it carries the same ranged weapons, pick 1 enemy unit that those attacks hit. Until your next turn starts, that unit has the effect named after that weapon:\n\n- **Bubblechukka**: it is **wobbled**, so the targets of its attacks gain the **[Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)** against them\n- **Kustom Mega-kannon**: it is **zapped**, with −1 **Ld**\n- **Smasha Gun**: it is **smashed**, with −2\" **M**\n- **Traktor Kannon**: it is **grounded** and cannot [take to the skies](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models)\n\nEach Mek Gun model starts with 5 Grot Crew tokens beside it. Remove 1 each time that model loses a wound; the model itself stands for its final wound.",
